     "size": 27,
     "align": "left"
    },
    {
     "id": "body",
     "visible": true,
     "kicker": "",
     "title": "",
     "italic": "",
     "body": "A Life discloses its World through the means by which it lives. Objective Internality names this constituted means; Subjective Immediacy names the knower; World names the known; Life / Mind holds the whole relation. Six developed aspects: Central, meaningful continuity; Actuation, living articulation; AIKit, potency; Software Factory, transformation; Workcell, situated existence; Quaternal Logic, Transcendent Relation. Read together they are offices of paradigmatic existence — paradigm is not a seventh product.",
