   "text": [
    {
     "id": "editorial",
     "visible": true,
     "kicker": "S3 · ARGUED · M40",
     "title": "S3 — Software Factory: transformation",
     "italic": "MEF pair L3 Processual × L2′ Alchemical-Elemental · movement M40 · parent S",
     "body": "",
     "x": 0.033,
     "y": 0.04,
     "width": 440,
     "size": 25,
     "align": "left"
    },
    {
     "id": "body",
     "visible": true,
     "kicker": "",
     "title": "",
     "italic": "",
     "body": "Software Factory is transformation: the process through which intention, action, encounter and learning become changed form. Development is not merely production of artifacts. Something is wanted, a possibility is entertained, a form is attempted, actuality resists or confirms it, and what happened is gathered back into the conditions of what can happen next.",
     "x": 0.57,
     "y": 0.06,
     "width": 430,
     "size": 14,
     "align": "left"
    },
    {
     "id": "lens1",
     "visible": true,
     "kicker": "L3 Processual: desire enters actuality",
     "title": "",
     "italic": "",
     "body": "Concrescent desire is the lure or pressure by which something wants to become. Actual occasion is the concrete event in which that possibility is attempted. Ingression is the entry of possible form into actuality. Eternal objects name the available forms through which the occasion can take shape. Community integration asks whether the resulting form can enter the wider world that must sustain it. Satisfaction/Perishing names both completion and passage into inherited condition.",
     "x": 0.033,
     "y": 0.57,
     "width": 390,
     "size": 14,
     "align": "left"
    },
    {
     "id": "lens2",
     "visible": true,
     "kicker": "L2′ Alchemical-Elemental: transformation has a material grammar",
     "title": "",
     "italic": "",
     "body": "Aether is the open field of possibility in which the work can begin. Earth gives resistance, material, inherited body and constraint. Water carries flow, adaptation and mixture. Air mediates, communicates, abstracts and relates. Fire transforms through energetic difference, conflict, testing and irreversible passage. Salt precipitates the attained form: the result that can persist, circulate and become material for another becoming.",
     "x": 0.51,
     "y": 0.57,
     "width": 400,
     "size": 14,
     "align": "left"
    }
   ],
