   "text": [
    {
     "id": "editorial",
     "visible": true,
     "kicker": "S4 · ARGUED · M41",
     "title": "S4 — Workcell: situated existence",
     "italic": "MEF pair L4 Phenomenological × L1′ Phenomenal · movement M41 · parent S",
     "body": "",
     "x": 0.033,
     "y": 0.04,
     "width": 440,
     "size": 25,
     "align": "left"
    },
    {
     "id": "body",
     "visible": true,
     "kicker": "",
     "title": "",
     "italic": "",
     "body": "Workcell is situated existence: the concrete here in which a Life finds itself, encounters resistance, becomes available to others and makes activity materially consequential. Situation is not an accessory added to an otherwise complete subject. A Life is already somewhere: embodied, temporal, exposed to conditions it did not wholly choose, enabled by some relations and constrained by others.",
     "x": 0.57,
     "y": 0.06,
     "width": 430,
     "size": 14,
     "align": "left"
    },
    {
     "id": "lens1",
     "visible": true,
     "kicker": "L4 Phenomenological: thrown into a world",
     "title": "",
     "italic": "",
     "body": "Being names the fact that the Life is already there before any inventory of its local resources. Thrownness names inherited circumstance not wholly self-authored. Being-there is the concrete localisation of that existence. Temporality means the situation has a before and after. Care names involvement: some things matter from here. Releasement opens the possibility of loosening a present grasp so another relation can become available.",
     "x": 0.033,
     "y": 0.57,
     "width": 390,
     "size": 14,
     "align": "left"
    },
    {
     "id": "lens2",
     "visible": true,
     "kicker": "L1′ Phenomenal: the aperture of encounter",
     "title": "",
     "italic": "",
     "body": "Introversion · Sensation · Feeling · Thinking · Intuition · Extroversion name differentiated modes through which a situated Life encounters itself and World. Input channels, telemetry, logs, local state, inference and output can be organised into an aperture; that does not establish that sensation or feeling is phenomenally present. The pair remains broader than its technical refraction.",
     "x": 0.51,
     "y": 0.57,
     "width": 400,
     "size": 14,
     "align": "left"
    }
   ],
